          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
            What's the most important spec to check on a budget treadmill?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed m-0">
            Continuous horsepower (CHP) matters more than peak horsepower
            marketing numbers. Look for at least 2.0-2.5 CHP for walking and
            light jogging, and 2.75-3.0 CHP if you plan to run. Weight
            capacity relative to your household's heaviest user is the
            second most important factor, since machines rated closer to
